# Dependencies are installed, never committed: `pnpm install` rebuilds this tree,
# and one accidental commit of it already sits in the history (0.2.x).
node_modules/

# Scratch directories (probe scripts, unpacked platform sources, packing tests).
# `selftest-v3.mjs` writes to the OS temp dir, not here — this stays because the
# next investigation will want somewhere to put its scripts, and `.tmp-` is
# where every one of them has gone so far.
.tmp-*/

# Tarballs from `pnpm pack`.
*.tgz

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Project notes kept outside version control.
.workbuddy

# Local only — never uploaded, never packaged.
#
# What gets published is what a user installs, and what gets pushed is what a
# user browses. The offline assertion suite (`selftest-v3.mjs`), the scoring
# harness with its two reference transcripts (`eval-v3.mjs`, `eval/`), and the
# maintainer's own notes (`MAINTAINER.md`) are useful only here: the plugin
# imports none of them, so they can live in the working tree without ever being
# shipped. `npm test` still reads them from disk.
MAINTAINER.md
selftest-v3.mjs
eval-v3.mjs
eval/

设计方案.md